                                                "sense_id": "d4972dda-d38a-3420-9795-f165751e6208",
                                                "text": "‹Why did I always think the ladies' room would be less gross? How do you girls freaking miss with your plumbing!?›"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f9c18184-7f22-3795-9d8b-8a12ac9499fb",
